<title>UK: TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES SEMIFINALS RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-WIMBLEDON WOMEN'S SINGLES SEMIFINALS RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Women's singles semifinal results</p>
<p>at the Wimbledon tennis championships on Thursday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>1-Martina Hingis (Switzerland) beat Anna Kournikova (Russia)</p>
<p>6-3 6-2</p>
